Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think back to the time\Nwhen my search first began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.81,0:00:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I left behind those shores of sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.39,0:00:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the endless everlasting\Nworld out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.55,0:00:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that with this\Nburning passion driving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.91,0:00:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday, somewhere, I'll finally see the\Nlight I have searched for everywhere.?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.13,0:00:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the summer sun is shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.85,0:00:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shaking the sails of my heart. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.63,0:01:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A brand new world
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.51,0:01:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that has been hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.91,0:01:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has opened up its doors for me to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.07,0:01:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wearing in the troubled waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.47,0:01:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From all despair I can be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.97,0:01:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the horizon on the other side is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.69,0:01:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And though I've traveled far\Nfrom where my search began.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.69,0:01:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over seas of green and shores of sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.29,0:01:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the endless\Neverlasting world I bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.45,0:01:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that with this\Nburning passion driving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.79,0:01:44.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some days I'm where I'll finally see\Nthe light. I will search for everywhere?
