Dialogue: 3,0:06:17.21,0:06:20.50,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,0)\shad0\bord0\blur0.6\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs70\pos(720,700)}Mock Town, Jaya
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.25,0:06:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maud Blanc Cricket is an ascendant\Nof the infamous Maud Blanc Nolan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.45,0:06:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard that fairy tale\Nall the time as a kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.17,0:06:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I never knew that Jaya was the island\Nwhere he thought he saw the City of Gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.87,0:06:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we were growing up in the North Blue,\Nwe were always warned that if we lied,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.95,0:06:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'd suffer the same fate\Nas Nolan and be ridiculed?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.33,0:06:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,until we were eventually put to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.77,0:06:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes perfect sense that\NCricket's related to that fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.77,0:06:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't believe that Jaya is\Nthe island from the fairy tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.41,0:06:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon the intrusion, but\Nif I heard you correctly,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.25,0:06:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're saying a descendant\Nof Nolan is here
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.13,0:06:55.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,400 years after the fact\Nlooking for that gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.95,0:06:58.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got to be doing\Nthis to clear his family
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.09,0:07:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,name and regain some\Nsmall amount of respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.23,0:07:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This story keeps getting\Nbetter and better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.29,0:07:12.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can he seriously hope to\Nwipe away over 400 years of
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.63,0:07:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,embarrassment by bringing\Nback a few pieces of gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.41,0:07:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.89,0:07:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like he's a few\Nbricks short of a wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.95,0:07:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alas, the liar died before he\Ncould prove himself to the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.77,0:07:39.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All he ever really wanted to do\Nwas live the life of an adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.41,0:07:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That last part's not in the book!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.97,0:07:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't try to tack on your\Nown sentimental nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.83,0:07:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he just fall in the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.11,0:07:49.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.31,0:07:51.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.03,0:07:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got nerve relaxing at\Nsomeone's house without permission?
Dialogue: 2,0:07:52.39,0:07:57.77,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(477,0)\bord2\blur15\1a&HFF&\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs70\pos(720,570)}Pirate Mont Blanc Cricket\NSaruyama Alliance's Last Boss{Gaijin/Ravenfire}
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.39,0:07:57.77,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(477,0)\shad0\bord0.5\blur0.6\1a&HFF&\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs70\pos(720,570)\3c&HFFFFFF&}Pirate Mont Blanc Cricket\NSaruyama Alliance's Last Boss
Dialogue: 3,0:07:52.39,0:07:57.77,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(477,0)\shad0\bord0\blur0.6\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fs70\pos(720,570)}Pirate Mont Blanc Cricket\NSaruyama Alliance's Last Boss
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.35,0:07:57.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my land and I suggest you leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.67,0:08:00.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry Usopp, move it, go and\Nfish Luffy out of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.23,0:08:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know why you're here,\Nyou're after my goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.65,0:08:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. This guy's a terrible shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.77,0:08:19.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.11,0:08:22.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idiot, never underestimate your bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.77,0:08:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of the way, I'll handle this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.11,0:08:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really need to learn\Nto be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.23,0:08:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I thought I saw bubbles in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.27,0:08:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I looked closer, and\Nthen a chestnut appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.09,0:08:44.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it wasn't a chestnut.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.61,0:08:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a guy, and he pulled me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.99,0:08:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.19,0:08:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need more cold towels.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.05,0:08:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And open up those windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.03,0:08:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's caisson disease?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.55,0:09:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this guy is really sick, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.25,0:09:03.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, caisson disease is an illness\Nthat sometimes affects divers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.03,0:09:07.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though it's called a disease, it\Nisn't actually a chronic condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.25,0:09:11.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's caused by a lack of decompression\Nwhen surfacing from the seabed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.11,0:09:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The nitrogen in the blood\Nreleases too quickly and
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.91,0:09:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,causes gas bubbles to form\Nin the circulatory system.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.09,0:09:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when those gas bubbles expand,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.15,0:09:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they can cause considerable\Ndamage to muscles
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.25,0:09:23.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and joints and seriously\Ndecrease blood flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.93,0:09:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's a mystery disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.65,0:09:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think you can help him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.79,0:09:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My guess is he kept diving every day without\Nallowing time for his body to recover,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.99,0:09:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it finally caught up with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.55,0:09:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why he passed out during the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.45,0:09:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why in the world did he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.45,0:09:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but he\Nwas taking a big risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.57,0:09:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In some cases, caisson disease can\Ncause death, so he's lucky to be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.23,0:10:01.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Masira, I guess\Nyou're still alive after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.49,0:10:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you say that? Forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.85,0:10:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know what all that\Ngunfire was about earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.01,0:10:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure, but that's where\NI'm headed now to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.41,0:10:10.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, come on then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.35,0:10:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about the old-timer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.99,0:10:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, old-timer, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.27,0:10:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've come to kill us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.43,0:10:22.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world are\Nyou people doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.79,0:10:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just what are you\Ndoing to our friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.71,0:10:25.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're trying to help,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.01,0:10:29.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I suggest you either lend us a\Nhand or find someone else to buy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.13,0:10:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't antagonize them, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.49,0:10:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what they're capable of!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.67,0:10:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now there's two of\Nthose savages to deal with!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.87,0:10:34.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're savages!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.93,0:10:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone jump out the\Nwindows and run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.71,0:10:38.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.37,0:10:41.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did they say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.45,0:10:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you guys live on this island, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.01,0:10:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.92,0:10:47.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this old-timer's house is the official
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.27,0:10:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,headquarters of the\NSaruyama Alliance of Jaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.09,0:10:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We call this home, but we spend\Nmost of our time on our ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.87,0:10:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're more comfortable at sea, because\Nthis place is too small for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.05,0:10:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are too big for your own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.21,0:10:59.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's all in how you\Nlook at it, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.99,0:11:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To a giant, you'd still look like\Nnothing more than a ball of earwax.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.73,0:11:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, those three sure are getting\Nalong well now, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.59,0:11:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, seems like they\Nhave a lot in common.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.77,0:11:11.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty impressed you managed\Nto get Machida here off your ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.51,0:11:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's quite a feat for someone as\Nsmall as you to overpower him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.47,0:11:16.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eh, it wasn't really that hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.35,0:11:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.26,0:11:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you could kick his ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.49,0:11:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wolf, he's waking up. He's awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.87,0:11:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.67,0:11:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.69,0:11:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't kick Masi's ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.41,0:11:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, chestnut head, I\Ngot a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.55,0:11:39.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I attacked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.29,0:11:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you were\Nnothing more than another
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.03,0:11:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,group of bandits who had\Ncome to steal my gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.41,0:11:45.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did someone say something about gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.33,0:11:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just calm down, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.57,0:11:48.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exactly was it you wanted to ask me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.89,0:11:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're searching for Sky Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.49,0:11:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we were told you might be\Nable to tell us how to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.87,0:11:54.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.69,0:12:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you really\Nbelieve that place exists!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.37,0:12:03.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.35,0:12:04.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't attack a sick man!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.73,0:12:06.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean there's no Sky Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.21,0:12:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.17,0:12:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.45,0:12:15.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, nobody knows if the Sky\NIsland really exists or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.29,0:12:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know of only one man who claims\Nto have seen the island for himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.09,0:12:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he's considered a\Nliar of epic proportions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.91,0:12:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.45,0:12:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's an old fairy tale that the\Npeople of the North Blue know very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.45,0:12:32.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's called Noland the Liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.77,0:12:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop looking at me, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.33,0:12:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's not Nolan! Is he right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.53,0:12:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And is this island the one\Nmentioned in the fairy tale?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.17,0:12:44.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Nolan's my grandfather's\Ngrandfather's grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.01,0:12:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a distant ancestor of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.99,0:12:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am his descendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.57,0:12:50.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we're so far removed,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.13,0:12:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt there's even a single\Ndrop of his blood in my veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.81,0:12:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Mont Blanc family was driven out of\Nthe North Blue Country a long time ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.95,0:13:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we've managed to keep a\Nvery low profile ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.59,0:13:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People still denounce the family name,\Nbut we've never despised him for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.81,0:13:07.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.47,0:13:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because Nolan, contrary to popular\Nbelief, was a very honest person.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.07,0:13:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not what the fairy tale said.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.13,0:13:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As the story goes, Nolan's\Nlast words were as follows.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.91,0:13:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can only assume that the\NCity of Gold sunk into the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.23,0:13:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This line is accompanied by an\Nidiotic face in the illustration.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.35,0:13:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Noland was no idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.65,0:13:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knew what he saw, and I\Nbelieve he wasn't lying about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.21,0:13:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noland was sure the island\Nhe stumbled upon where he
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.03,0:13:37.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,found the ruins of a city of\Ngold was the island of Jaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.09,0:13:40.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But when he returned with\Nthe king, there was no gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.29,0:13:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unsuccessful,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.20,0:13:45.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he insisted that the ancient city had\Nsubmerged due to shifts in the Earth's crust.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.87,0:13:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But everyone dismissed this as the\Nlast-ditch excuse of a doomed man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.69,0:13:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noland was given a public execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.13,0:13:55.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he died, so did his discoveries.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.59,0:13:57.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only the legend of the Liar remained.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.51,0:13:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.42,0:14:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're trying to find the Ancient City\Nof Gold at the bottom of the sea in
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.83,0:14:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,order to finally clear the Mont Blanc\Nfamily name and prove Noland right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.79,0:14:04.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.81,0:14:12.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't really care if the Ancient\NCity of Gold exists or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.25,0:14:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The actions of my ancestor have\Nnothing to do with me and my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.73,0:14:18.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't possibly begin\Nto imagine what it's like?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.17,0:14:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a kid for everyone to\Nlaugh at you and ridicule
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.61,0:14:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you because you're a\Ndescendant of that idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.13,0:14:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noland.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.04,0:14:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I've dealt with my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.85,0:14:28.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.76,0:14:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,over the past 400 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.81,0:14:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a great many of my family have\Nset sail to find the city of gold,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.61,0:14:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,prove Noland right, and\Nrestore the Mont Blanc name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.97,0:14:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But each and every one\Nof them went missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.39,0:14:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was ashamed to be a member\Nof such a pathetic family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.55,0:14:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I decided to leave home\Nand become a pirate. Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.49,0:14:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're a pirate just like us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.23,0:14:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't even really\Nwant to become a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.57,0:14:54.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wanted out of Nolan's\Nshadow to be my own man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.31,0:14:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But over time, I came to\Nassemble my own pirate crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.99,0:15:00.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, I was seen as a leader,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.55,0:15:05.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not a laughingstock, and I spanned\Nthe world looking for adventures.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.29,0:15:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then 10 years ago, So as my\Ncrew and I sailed the calm sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.95,0:15:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we discovered this\Nisland purely by chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.83,0:15:12.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And ironically,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.13,0:15:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of all my family members who sought out\Nthis place, who lost their lives doing so,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.77,0:15:19.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it was I who found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.43,0:15:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I who despised the Mont Blanc name!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.37,0:15:25.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We came ashore, but found no\Ntrace of the City of Gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.01,0:15:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I stood on a cape of the island and\Nfelt I was destined to be there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.05,0:15:33.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's settle this,\NNoland, once and for all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.87,0:15:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're on your own!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.78,0:15:36.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want anything to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.61,0:15:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're setting sail and leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.23,0:15:40.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to stay here and\Nsearch for gold that doesn't exist,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.87,0:15:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're doing it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.53,0:15:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So long, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.33,0:15:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care if I find the city or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.05,0:15:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not here to prove\NNolan right or wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.67,0:15:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no interest in rewriting history.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.95,0:16:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I'm doing is following\Nwhat I believe is my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.39,0:16:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is between me and Nolan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.69,0:16:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm facing what I fear, and whatever the\Noutcome, the act is all that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.81,0:16:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, what a sad story.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.43,0:16:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what about the monkeys?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.13,0:16:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did they come to be on\Nthis island with you anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.21,0:16:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that's another story of\Nbravery in the face of incredible odds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.37,0:16:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your life reads like a great\Nbook, you know, Cricket?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.05,0:16:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were just fans of the fairy tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.15,0:16:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're fans?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.51,0:16:34.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did they find you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.69,0:16:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it was five or six years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.67,0:16:39.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They heard a rumor and set out to find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.41,0:16:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two truly believe that the\NCity of Gold exists somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.85,0:16:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they're helping me find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.33,0:16:50.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoujo, you have no idea what\Nyou just got yourself into!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.33,0:16:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring it on, you big ape!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.55,0:16:52.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready when you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.77,0:16:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just step up and you'll get knocked down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.63,0:16:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sea surrounding this island\Nis very deep, and in those dark,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.93,0:17:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cold depths, you're surrounded\Nby a profound sense of solitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.83,0:17:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I first arrived here, I spent\Nmy time searching the seabed alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.93,0:17:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They entered my life\Nwithout permission and
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.39,0:17:13.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,assigned themselves as\Nmy crew without asking!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.67,0:17:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they do nothing\Nbut fight all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.39,0:17:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But having these idiots\Naround puts me at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.05,0:17:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And truthfully, I enjoy their company?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.25,0:17:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.79,0:17:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.65,0:17:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,True friends lift each other up and give\Neach other strength in times of need!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.21,0:17:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you just about finished\Ntelling us your life story?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.23,0:17:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth, you ungrateful brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.43,0:17:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.34,0:17:42.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, all I really want to\Nknow about is Sky Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.27,0:17:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a pushy guy, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.31,0:17:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But like I told you earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.09,0:17:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only person who's ever\Nseen the Sky Island is Noland,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.17,0:17:55.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and nobody knows if he was telling the\Ntruth or if it was just another tall tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.43,0:17:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there any record of\Nhis trip to the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.03,0:18:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Officially, no, but he\Ndoes mention it in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.21,0:18:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you have there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.33,0:18:04.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That isn't Nolan's logbook, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.39,0:18:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.30,0:18:08.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Read from the bottom of that page.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.05,0:18:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.96,0:18:12.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This logbook is over 400 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.57,0:18:16.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,June City, year 1120, a sunny\Nday on the Sea of Ephemeris.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.15,0:18:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Upon departing from the Jolly Villa,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.11,0:18:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we left the harbor and sailed\Ninto the rising sun at a
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.01,0:18:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,heading of east by northeast\Nwith the wind at our back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.75,0:18:29.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At midday, we happened to cross\Na bumboat carrying a rare item.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.53,0:18:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A single-person contraption\Ncalled a sky waver. This small,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.15,0:18:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mysterious vessel can\Ngenerate its own wind
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.47,0:18:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and sail at great speeds\Neven on a still day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.99,0:18:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the ski-like ship was\Nnot easily maneuvered.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.43,0:18:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't control it, although my\Ncrew has taken quite a liking to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.05,0:18:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta get one of those things!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.85,0:18:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.76,0:18:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't stop reading!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.03,0:18:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.94,0:18:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we were told the vessel had been\Nmanufactured on the Sky Island
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.61,0:18:55.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that many more interesting\Ndevices could be found there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.39,0:18:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It brought to mind an\Nexplorer friend of mine
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.61,0:18:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who once showed me the\Nmost unusual specimen,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.77,0:19:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a living skyfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.25,0:19:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have never seen a fish with such a\Nbizarre appearance in all my years!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.57,0:19:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This island remains the only unexplored\Ndomain and as a sailor and adventurer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.71,0:19:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel it is my destiny to one\Nday reach the sea in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.85,0:19:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mont Blanc Noland.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.45,0:19:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know what this means?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.99,0:19:17.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sky island must really exist!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.05,0:19:19.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like Robin said it did!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.05,0:19:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we just got to figure\Nout how to get there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.21,0:19:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.12,0:19:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.04,0:19:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.95,0:19:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better than ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.86,0:19:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.93,0:19:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.15,0:19:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.35,0:19:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think of those guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.93,0:19:39.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why ask an old timer?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.47,0:19:42.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems that they're\Ndetermined to get to Sky Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.67,0:19:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.58,0:19:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sky Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.45,0:19:46.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.53,0:19:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one way\Nfor them to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.49,0:19:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if they try to get there\Non their own, they'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.71,0:19:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.97,0:19:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we should help them along.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.05,0:19:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what do you guys think about that?

